# Classroom Prompt Builder (US MVP v1.2.0)

## Product

- **Site:** https://promptanatomy.online — free K–12 prompt builder + optional paid PDF guides ($4.99 / $9.99).
- **Stack:** static root (no build step) + Vercel serverless `api/*`.
- **Core files:** `index.html`, `success.html`, `privacy.html`, `terms.html`, `generator.js`, `copy.js`, `style.css`, `config/sot.json`, `icons.js`, `assets/icons.svg`.

## Repo boundary

- This repo is the **Vercel product + PDF fulfillment** repo: `promptanatomy.online`, Stripe checkout, Upstash Redis, Vercel Blob, transactional Resend, and `api/**`.
- School outreach is a separate sibling repo: `..\cpb-school-outreach` (Railway, Supabase Postgres, contact enrichment, campaign sending, marketing Resend — current From `hello@promptanatomy.blog`).
- Do **not** add outreach logic to Vercel `api/**`, Stripe fulfillment, Upstash, Blob, product env, or transactional email paths.
- For outreach tasks, work in `..\cpb-school-outreach` and follow its own `AGENTS.md` / Cursor rules / skills.

## User-facing language

- All product copy is **en-US** (`lang="en-US"`). Teacher-friendly, concrete, concise.
- Do **not** use Lithuanian „Tu“ or informal LT tone in UI, legal, or email copy.

## Agent workflow

- Roles and stage-gate: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md).
- Ambition / priority through 2027-01-01: [`docs/roadmap.md`](../../docs/roadmap.md) — discovery-led; **non-go** new PDF SKUs and classroom workflow OS (skill `product-roadmap`).
- Agent docs ([`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)) and product copy are **English** (en-US for product UI).

## Documentation

- Active docs + Doc routing: [`docs/INDEX.md`](../../docs/INDEX.md) (Active GTM: `docs/roadmap.md`, `docs/marketing_plan.md`).
- Operator runbooks (INDEX Operator, not Active): [`todo.md`](../../todo.md), [`memo_pdf.md`](../../memo_pdf.md), [`docs/mobile-prelaunch-audit_2026-07.md`](../../docs/mobile-prelaunch-audit_2026-07.md).

## Single source of truth (SOT)

- [`config/sot.json`](../../config/sot.json) — modes, theme, `commerce`, `pdfGuides`, `buyerFaq`, `legal`.
- Commerce copy and Stripe URLs: `config/sot.json#commerce` — hydrate via `data-commerce-*` / `data-stripe-cta` hooks in `index.html`, not hardcoded marketing strings.

## Security

- Never commit secrets (`.env`, API keys, tokens).
- Production API: no sensitive data in logs; avoid `console.log` in shipped paths.

## Quality gates

Canonical change-type → test matrix: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) § Quality gates.  
**CI truth:** `.github/workflows/ci.yml` runs `npm run test:mixed`, then `test:webkit` and `test:lighthouse` — match or exceed locally before PR.

